21
00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:45.372
It still knows where in the bar a key is,

22
00:00:45.372 --> 00:00:47.437
because the bar phase of four point seven

23
00:00:47.437 --> 00:00:49.749
point two is in every key: all its weight

24
00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:51.913
