26
00:00:53.979 --> 00:00:54.224
song.

27
00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:55.946
But it cannot tell which bar.

28
00:00:56.241 --> 00:00:58.159
The two silent bars at the start score

29
00:00:58.159 --> 00:01:00.077
