41
00:01:25.269 --> 00:01:26.380
grows with distance.

42
00:01:26.838 --> 00:01:28.005
Here it is for key j.

43
00:01:28.339 --> 00:01:30.562
First the content score from four point

44
00:01:30.562 --> 00:01:33.341
