50
00:01:42.785 --> 00:01:45.438
The worked slot, block one, head zero, key

51
00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:47.766
five seven three, three slots back:

52
00:01:47.766 --> 00:01:50.094
content six point three six six, minus a

53
00:01:50.094 --> 00:01:52.476
quarter times three, gives five point six

54
00:01:52.476 --> 00:01:52.909
one six.

55
00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:55.562
In the code this is the bias of four point

56
00:01:55.562 --> 00:01:58.214
