59
00:02:01.489 --> 00:02:02.930
Why subtract a straight line?

60
00:02:03.227 --> 00:02:05.413
Because softmax takes e to the score, and

61
00:02:05.413 --> 00:02:07.697
e to a difference is a product: e to the

62
00:02:07.697 --> 00:02:09.783
