104
00:03:35.883 --> 00:03:38.152
four, about fifty-five times, smaller.

105
00:03:38.641 --> 00:03:41.062
Four divided by each slope: sixteen slots,

106
00:03:41.062 --> 00:03:42.998
one bar, two seconds at a hundred and

107
00:03:42.998 --> 00:03:45.564
twenty; sixty-four slots, four bars; two

108
00:03:45.564 --> 00:03:47.887
